                            <CAN-ENTER-EXCLUSIVE-AREA-REF DEST="EXCLUSIVE-AREA">/MICROSAR/Com_ib_bswmd/BswModuleDescriptions/Com/ComBehavior/COM_EXCLUSIVE_AREA_BOTH</CAN-ENTER-EXCLUSIVE-AREA-REF>
